      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHRONIC LOLA (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Nicmac Storm (23.38) in a Maiden. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Deserves serious consideration. CLIFTON (6) has hit the frame in all of his three runs, the latest finishing second (23.49) at this track. Must include in calculations. CHRONIC DON (2) is still a maiden after eight runs but rarely out of the placings, the latest filling a minor again when fifth at Maitland. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CHOCOLATE MALT (8) has definite claims at her first try at this journey.",
